OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer, 87, suffered
OL,4,A'unsurvivable' injuries after being
OL,5,Astruck by cow
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 87-year-old farmer died after
OL,8,Fsuffering "unsurvivable" injuries when
OL,9,Fhe was struck by a cow in
OL,10,FAberdeenshire, a sheriff has said.
OL,12,FDavid Ewan was taken to hospital after
OL,13,Fthe incident at Ferniebrae Farm,
OL,14,FStonehaven, in June last year but could
OL,15,Fnot be saved.
OL,17,FA fatal accident inquiry (FAI) heard
OL,18,Fcattle was being moved onto a lorry to
OL,19,Fbe transported for slaughter when one
OL,20,Fof the cows turned and ran towards him.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
